    <description>MonoGame is an open source implementation of the Microsoft XNA 4.x Framework. The goal is to make it easy for XNA developers to create cross-platform games with extremely high code reuse.

This package provides you with MonoGame Framework that works on several different platforms.</description>
    <summary>This package is a Linux OpenGL ES of MonoGame. Created by Codefoco to make it easier to work with MonoGame as a dependency</summary>
